res: [documentserver, browser]`).\n- **P2:** run the existing tests in `external/sdkjs/tests/common` (api, charts, color-mods) so they can serve as the oracle. The Atlas card says there is no oracle (`none`) without having checked these.\n\n**What would change it:** downgrade to keep if P1 finds this module is under 15 % of the time, and drop the font refactor if fonts already load in parallel.\n\n**Not done:** I didn't run any profiling or tests (outside this packet's scope). The line counts come from the Atlas card, not from tool data. I didn't read any other diagnosis of this module; I read the sdkjs-word one only for its format. The packet log and the friction line are filled in.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- The sdkjs cards should record the existing test suites rather than saying \"no oracle\" without checking.\n- The serial font loading belongs in the sdkjs-common card's Hotspots section.\n- The factory's permissions refused read-only commands chained together (`ls; head; git -C`), so I had to run them one at a time.","ttft_ms":2074,"type":"result","duration_ms":65370,"uuid":"3233609b-9a47-4dc2-b228-ef1bb256ea2f","ttft_stream_ms":804,"time_to_request_ms":301,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":4,"system_prompt":130,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":31,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":10,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":9,"init_frame_send":7,"engine_pickup":12,"loop_entry":6,"message_prep":2,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":3,"request_announcements":18,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":20,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":26,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":7},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":71,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":193,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":209,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":133,"process_rss_mib_result":235,"process_anon_mib_result":144,"process_peak_rss_mib":245,"